# Rust
/target
**/target
Cargo.lock

# Node / client
node_modules
client/dist
client/.npm
# Generated by the retired Vercel runner branch; never commit local leftovers.
client/public/course

# Vercel CLI + local secrets (created by `vercel link` / `vercel env pull`).
.vercel
.env*

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea
.vscode

# Tooling
.serena/

# Learner's working files — the canonical exercise lives in chapters/*/.exercise.rs;
# src/lib.rs is prepared by scripts/prepare-exercises.mjs and edited freely, so we don't track it.
chapters/*/src/lib.rs

# Example workspaces keep their lockfiles; generated snippet sources are throwaway.
!examples/large-service/Cargo.lock
!examples/snippets/Cargo.lock
examples/snippets/src/bin/
examples/snippets/tests/
